Hi Florian,



We don't use autodesk so there are no DWG files available. We use OpenSCAD =
which is a text-based parametic CAD that allows us to collaborate and build=
 the STLs on the GitLab CI. All openscad files are in our GitLab repo here:
https://gitlab.com/openflexure/openflexure-microscope

Just to check are you using the new v3 server in development or are you usi=
ng v2? I'd highly recommend using v3 as it is on the new picamera stack. We=
 are interested in Pi5, but it hasn't reached the top of our proprieties ye=
t in the transfer to v3. I think you should be able to get it working with =
a PISP tuning file for the IMX500, all the code is available here:

https://gitlab.com/openflexure/openflexure-microscope-server

Test images are built and shared via the forum. We would be interested to h=
ear how your Pi5 migration goes. Would you be happy to sare on our forum so=
 the whole community can see?



Best wishes



Julian


